{"step_index":223,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T13:31:05Z","content":"Created At: 2026-08-25T19:01:05+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-08-25T19:01:06+05:30\nFile Path: `file:///C:/Users/renu5/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/nexlev_oauth/login.html`\nTotal Lines: 8\nTotal Bytes: 931\nShowing lines 1 to 8\nThe following code has been modified to include a line number before every line, in the format: <line_number>: <original_line>. Please note that any changes targeting the original code should remove the line number, colon, and leading space.\n1: <!DOCTYPE html>\r\n2: <html>\r\n3: <head><meta http-equiv=\"refresh\" content=\"0;url=https://auth.nexlev.io/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=chatgpt-mcp-client&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A6274%2Foauth%2Fcallback&scope=openid+profile+email&state=98brHLrpsEo93nIrgWKQilaxHZ2DKTL1WvwK8LDBiCU&code_challenge=YflNKT715yRSvC8kAGotOd-dDlb8H0C-tnzBA2ARkyQ&code_challenge_method=S256\"></head>\r\n4: <body style=\"background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff;font-family:sans-serif;text-align:center;padding-top:100px\">\r\n5: <h2>Redirecting to NexLev login...</h2>\r\n6: <p>If not redirected, <a href=\"https://auth.nexlev.io/authorize?response_type=code&client_id=chatgpt-mcp-client&redirect_uri=http%3A%2F%2Flocalhost%3A6274%2Foauth%2Fcallback&scope=openid+profile+email&state=98brHLrpsEo93nIrgWKQilaxHZ2DKTL1WvwK8LDBiCU&code_challenge=YflNKT715yRSvC8kAGotOd-dDlb8H0C-tnzBA2ARkyQ&code_challenge_method=S256\" style=\"color:#00ff88\">click here</a></p>\r\n7: </body>\r\n8: </html>\nThe above content shows the entire, complete file contents of the requested file.\n"}
