{"step_index":253,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-25T18:15:12Z","content":"Now the bridge is built and registered. But **it needs your NexLev API key** to authenticate. \n\nHere's the situation: NexLev's MCP endpoint requires authentication. There are only 2 ways to get it:\n\n### 👉 Go to your NexLev dashboard → Click **\"NexLev API\"** in the left sidebar\n\nIt will show you an **API key** (a long string). Copy it and paste it here.\n\nOnce you give me the key, I'll put it in the config and the bridge will work instantly — same as your vidIQ setup. No browser login, no OAuth, no approval pages. Just paste the key and we're done.\n\n**This is the last step. One copy-paste and NexLev is connected forever.** 🎯"}
